  "priorExpiration": "2014-06-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 801.01 Pesticide and Pesticide Container Disposal. No person shall dispose of, discard, store, or transport any pesticides or pesticide containers in a manner inconsistent with requirements of the department of environmental services pursuant to Env-Hw 500, the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency pursuant to 40 CFR 261-262, the division, or as stated upon the pesticide label.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #5127, eff 4-29-91; ss by #6317, eff 8-13-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12\n\nNew. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14\n\nNew. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #13981, eff 5-31-24",
